  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
  Upstream NOTICE: "The model architecture is inspired by the DualAR design
  used in Fish Audio S2 Pro."

Modifications in this project: the model weights were fine-tuned on Persian
speech (see README.md for the training procedure). The codec, tokenizer and
model code are redistributed unchanged.

Training data (not redistributed here):
  Mana-TTS, CC0-1.0, https://huggingface.co/datasets/MahtaFetrat/Mana-TTS
  GPTInformal-Persian, CC0-1.0, https://huggingface.co/datasets/MahtaFetrat/GPTInformal-Persian
  The dataset authors ask that the data not be used to replicate or imitate
  the speakers' voices for malicious purposes.

Central Kurdish (Sorani) model (separate notebook and model repo):
